&lt;p&gt;But what truly sets Razorpay apart is our culture. At Razorpay, ownership is our oxygen - you own what you build, with no micromanagement or red tape, just the runway to make your ideas fly. Learning is a lifestyle - if you’re curious, you’ll feel at home here. People &amp;gt; Pedigree - we hire for attitude, hustle, and hunger more than degrees. Transparency thrives over titles - this is where interns question CXOs and CXOs say “thank you.” Guided by our values of Customer First, Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership, Agility with Integrity, Transparency, Challenging the status quo and a strong belief that Razorpay grows with Razors,&amp;nbsp; you’ll be part of a 3000+ strong team building not just products, but the financial infrastructure of the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Razorpay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Razorpay is India&#39;s leading payments and financial services platform, founded in 2014 by Harshil Mathur and Shashank Kumar. We help businesses of every size accept, process and disburse payments at scale, and we have been first to market with most major payments innovations in India.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Having built strong foundations in India, we now operate in Malaysia, Singapore and the US, and are expanding into new markets. International Payments (i18n) takes Razorpay&#39;s products into these markets: local payment methods, cross-border flows, and the partnerships with banks, wallets and schemes that make them work. Much of this is 0 to 1 work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will own an international market end to end: deciding what to build, building it with engineering, taking it to merchants, and growing it. There is no running playbook to inherit. You will write it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a builder role as much as a product role. In a new market, Razorpay has no brand recall and few relationships, so you will open doors yourself: reach out to merchants, banks, wallets and partners, earn their trust from scratch, and turn those conversations into products they adopt.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;External stakeholder management, 0 to 1&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build relationships from scratch with merchants, banks, acquirers, wallets and ecosystem partners in a market where Razorpay is new.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Reach out first: identify the right partners and anchor merchants, approach them directly, and get the first meetings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Earn trust through follow-through: run pilots, close the loop on feedback, and turn early adopters into references.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Represent Razorpay in merchant meetings, partner negotiations, regulator and scheme conversations, and industry events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Travel extensively to be in market with customers and partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Strategy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define the long-term strategy and quarterly roadmap for your market, tied to GMV, active merchants and success rate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Size the opportunity, pick the segments and payment methods to win first, and decide what not to do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Track the competitive landscape, local and global, and adjust the plan as the market moves.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Product sense and 0 to 1 building&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Meet customers regularly and back their needs with qualitative and quantitative data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Start from the problem: frame it with data, test and iterate, and prioritise by value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Translate local payment methods, regulation and merchant pain points into clear product requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Write high-quality specs, manage scope, and ship MVPs on time with engineering, design and partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
