&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Razorpay is India&#39;s leading full-stack payments and financial services company. The SME Payments Group owns the end-to-end experience for small and medium businesses across 14 product pods: onboarding, activation, payments, dashboard, growth and AI-native products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Onboarding Infra is the platform layer under every merchant&#39;s first mile. It runs sign-up and identity, KYC and verification, and the workflow and state systems that take a business from sign-up to live payments while keeping Razorpay compliant with RBI and CKYC norms. It also powers agentic onboarding: RAY, our AI assistant, verifies and activates merchants through this team&#39;s APIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will own a platform whose consumers are other product teams, AI agents and regulators as much as merchants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will own six platform areas end to end, with a senior engineering team of principal, staff and senior engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
